abstract: >-
  Meu Artigo is an experimental ChatGPT plugin incorporating a scientific-research
  workflow skill for evidence-grounded article preparation, methodological guidance,
  researcher-controlled scientific gates, and provenance-aware research governance.
  This RC.4 software release is public, but independent scientific validation,
  host-wide user interface consistency and external tool access are not certified.

